{{> Start this}}

{{> CustomLogo this}}

{{> EmailTitle title=(t "Your email address was changed") }}

{{!--
  Sent to the address a status page private user had, once their address
  changed (#10156, Common/Types/StatusPage/PrivateUserEmailAddressChangedEmail,
  sent by Common/Server/Utils/StatusPage/PrivateUserEmailAddressChangedNotice
  from StatusPagePrivateUserService.onUpdateSuccess): the status page's team
  changed it, or its identity provider through SCIM. One email per change,
  in the page's branding and default language.

  It says that the address changed and to which, masked; when; who changed
  it, by role and never by name; and whom to ask. It has no link that does
  anything: undoing the change from this mailbox would work for whoever
  reads it (Types/Accounts/EmailAddressChangedEmail says why).

  The page's name is its team's words, so it goes into sentences through
  ttHtml, which escapes the whole sentence; the masked address and the time
  are values, on plainText. Everything else is OneUptime's own words, looked
  up in the reader's language (Utils/EmailLanguage.ts).
--}}

{{#if changedByStatusPageTeam}}
{{> InfoBlock info=(ttHtml "The team that runs {{statusPage}} changed the email address you sign in to it with, from this address to a new one." statusPage=statusPageName)}}
{{else if changedByIdentityProvider}}
{{> InfoBlock info=(ttHtml "Your organization's identity provider changed the email address you sign in to {{statusPage}} with, from this address to a new one." statusPage=statusPageName)}}
{{else}}
{{> InfoBlock info=(ttHtml "The email address you sign in to {{statusPage}} with was changed from this address to a new one." statusPage=statusPageName)}}
{{/if}}

{{> InfoBlock info=(tHtml "Emails about signing in, such as password resets and sign-in links, now go to the new address.")}}

{{!-- One card, as in every email: when, and to which address. --}}
{{> DetailBoxStart this }}
{{> DetailBoxField title=(t "Changed at:") plainText=changedAt }}
{{> DetailBoxField title=(t "New email address:") plainText=newEmailAddress }}
{{> DetailBoxEnd this }}

{{#if changedByIdentityProvider}}
{{> InfoBlock info=(tHtml "If you did not expect this, contact your organization's admin.")}}
{{else}}
{{> InfoBlock info=(ttHtml "If you did not expect this, contact the team that runs {{statusPage}}." statusPage=statusPageName)}}
{{/if}}

{{> VerticalSpace this}}

{{> End this}}
